:: Forest - toll retaliation won [bg-forest]
<h1 class="ptitle">FOREST</h1>
<br />

<<set _tollKilled = ($prevFight.killedEnemies ?? []).length > 0>>
<<set _tollCaptured = ($prevFight.defeatedEnemies ?? []).some(e => e.captured)>>

<<set _recovered = randomInteger(15, 35)>>
<<set $player.money += _recovered>>
<<set $player.reputation += 5>>

You take the caps off the crate before you leave — not all of them, just what seems right.
<br /><br />

<<if _tollKilled>>
    He won't be collecting from anyone's stretch again.
<<elseif _tollCaptured>>
    You hauled him to his feet and started back through the trees. He didn't argue. Didn't have the strength for it.
<<else>>
    He was still breathing when you walked away. He'd know better than to come back.
<</if>>
<br /><br />

<strong>+<<=_recovered>> caps recovered. Reputation +5.</strong>
<br /><br />

<<link 'Head back'>>
    <<goto 'Wood cabin'>>
<</link>>
